{
  "schema": "loadsketch/brief@1",
  "id": "brief-checkout",
  "title": "Brief: checkout",
  "text": "A team of 3, one month. Build a shop's back end: browsing and checkout. The brief gives you the two APIs: browse and checkout. Only the checkout API calls the external payment provider, which is already on the canvas. Every day it is slow for a while.",
  "functional": [
    "Users can view products",
    "Users can check out: the payment provider is called to charge them"
  ],
  "load": [
    "1,500 requests a second: 80% view products (reads), 20% check out (writes)",
    "From second 20 the payment provider is 40 times slower, for 20 seconds",
    "While the provider is slow, checkout may fail, but viewing products must not be affected"
  ],
  "given": [
    "The payment provider normally takes 50 ms for one charge, and you cannot change that",
    "Your code takes 5 ms on average for one request",
    "A database read takes 3 ms and a write 10 ms"
  ],
  "outOfScope": ["Charging twice", "Refunds", "Changing to another payment provider"],
  "scenario": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/scenario@1",
    "name": "Brief: checkout",
    "seed": 1,
    "durationS": 90,
    "warmupS": 5,
    "traffic": { "rps": 1500, "readRatio": 0.8 },
    "events": [{ "type": "slow", "atS": 20, "forS": 20, "node": "pay", "multiplier": 40 }]
  },
  "limits": { "maxErrorRate": 0.06, "maxP99Ms": 300, "budgetPerMonth": 1450, "maxPoints": 6 },
  "start": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: checkout",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      {
        "id": "pay",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Payment provider (outside)",
        "pos": [0, 380],
        "params": {
          "instances": 2,
          "concurrency": 64,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 50, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 200
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [],
    "apis": [
      { "name": "browse", "op": "read", "share": 0.8 },
      { "name": "checkout", "op": "write", "share": 0.2 }
    ]
  },
  "fixed": ["pay"],
  "needs": [
    {
      "kind": "reaches-node",
      "node": "pay",
      "text": "Checkouts reach the payment provider",
      "share": 0.65
    },
    { "kind": "looked" },
    { "kind": "not-degraded" }
  ],
  "hint": "Only the checkout API calls the payment provider: on the \"API → payment provider\" edge, under \"APIs on this edge\", pick only checkout, so browse requests do not go to the provider. When the provider is 40 times slower, a charge takes 2 seconds. 300 checkouts a second all wait and soon fill the API Server's slots, so browse requests cannot get in either. The checkouts in those slow 20 seconds cannot be saved anyway; what you must do is keep them from taking everything else down: set a timeout on the same edge and give up when the wait is too long. A timeout that is too long fills the slots just the same.",
  "reference": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: checkout",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      { "id": "lb", "kind": "load_balancer", "label": "Load balancer", "pos": [270, 200] },
      {
        "id": "api",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Shop API",
        "pos": [540, 200],
        "params": { "instances": 4 }
      },
      { "id": "db", "kind": "database", "label": "Product database", "pos": [1080, 80] },
      {
        "id": "pay",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Payment provider (outside)",
        "pos": [1080, 320],
        "params": {
          "instances": 2,
          "concurrency": 64,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 50, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 200
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      { "from": "users", "to": "lb" },
      { "from": "lb", "to": "api" },
      { "from": "api", "to": "db" },
      { "from": "api", "to": "pay", "apis": ["checkout"], "timeoutMs": 300 }
    ],
    "apis": [
      { "name": "browse", "op": "read", "share": 0.8 },
      { "name": "checkout", "op": "write", "share": 0.2 }
    ]
  },
  "naive": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: checkout",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      { "id": "lb", "kind": "load_balancer", "label": "Load balancer", "pos": [270, 200] },
      {
        "id": "api",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Shop API",
        "pos": [540, 200],
        "params": { "instances": 4 }
      },
      { "id": "db", "kind": "database", "label": "Product database", "pos": [1080, 80] },
      {
        "id": "pay",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Payment provider (outside)",
        "pos": [1080, 320],
        "params": {
          "instances": 2,
          "concurrency": 64,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 50, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 200
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      { "from": "users", "to": "lb" },
      { "from": "lb", "to": "api" },
      { "from": "api", "to": "db" },
      { "from": "api", "to": "pay", "apis": ["checkout"] }
    ],
    "apis": [
      { "name": "browse", "op": "read", "share": 0.8 },
      { "name": "checkout", "op": "write", "share": 0.2 }
    ]
  }
}
